{"id":"n90069-1-9","stage":1,"title":"약간 · 若干","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90069-1-9-1","ko":"커피에 설탕을 타 드릴까요?","zh":"需要我在咖啡里加糖吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"커피에","meaning":"咖啡","explanation":"커피：咖啡；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"커피","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27372","senseId":"2","lemma":"커피","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"커피에","audio":"/audio/66de329602f384b639f6.mp3"}},{"text":"설탕을","meaning":"糖，砂糖","explanation":"설탕：糖，砂糖；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"설탕","audio":"/audio/7921a3bb40fa91bb6caf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62507","senseId":"1","lemma":"설탕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"설탕을","audio":"/audio/ded5fef46adc9b902a8b.mp3"}},{"text":"타","meaning":"冲 ，泡 ，沏，对","explanation":"타다：冲 ，泡 ，沏，对；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91123","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타","audio":"/audio/7e40449e6f383f05b54a.mp3"}},{"text":"드릴까요?","meaning":"致，呈，献，奉上","explanation":"드리다：致，呈，献，奉上；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드릴까요","audio":"/audio/235c96fe68d709255264.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a4215a3126661d52","term":"커피","zh":"咖啡","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3","entryId":"27372","definition":"是一种用咖啡豆制作出来的、苦涩的深棕色饮品，其含有独特的香味及咖啡因。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"7921a3bb40fa91bb","term":"설탕","zh":"糖，砂糖","audio":"/audio/7921a3bb40fa91bb6caf.mp3","entryId":"62507","definition":"一种易溶于水的白色粉末，用于增加食物的甜味。","pronunciation":["설탕"]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"冲 ，泡 ，沏，对","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"91123","definition":"在多量液体里加入少量的液体或粉末而搅拌。","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"致，呈，献，奉上","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"(尊称)给。","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d5b7af15516638b03c58.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90069-1-9-2","ko":"아주 단 것은 싫으니까 약간만 넣어라.","zh":"我不要太甜的，只加一点点就好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}},{"text":"단","meaning":"甜，甘甜","explanation":"달다：甜，甘甜；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"달다","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62741","senseId":"1","lemma":"달다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"단","audio":"/audio/787a6732f255f31a3b2e.mp3"}},{"text":"것은","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것은","audio":"/audio/66faf3bab33879865298.mp3"}},{"text":"싫으니까","meaning":"讨厌","explanation":"싫다：讨厌；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"싫다","audio":"/audio/2011ef2922f6c340fc2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57271","senseId":"1","lemma":"싫다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싫으니까","audio":"/audio/c02754dd6a22a69ca394.mp3"}},{"text":"약간만","meaning":"若干","explanation":"약간：若干；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"약간","audio":"/audio/6e9f191f4dd510d3e5e1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90069","senseId":"1","lemma":"약간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"약간만","audio":"/audio/ec40d53a1f8823dc5d4f.mp3"}},{"text":"넣어라.","meaning":"划入，加上列入","explanation":"넣다：划入，加上列入；어라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"3","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넣어라","audio":"/audio/e0f6bb52387010494b21.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"bb552fc456991067","term":"달다","zh":"甜，甘甜","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3","entryId":"62741","definition":"与蜂蜜或糖的味道相似。","pronunciation":["달다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"东西，事，的","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"泛指各种事物或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"2011ef2922f6c340","term":"싫다","zh":"讨厌","audio":"/audio/2011ef2922f6c340fc2d.mp3","entryId":"57271","definition":"不中意。","pronunciation":["실타"]},{"id":"6e9f191f4dd510d3","term":"약간","zh":"若干","audio":"/audio/6e9f191f4dd510d3e5e1.mp3","entryId":"90069","definition":"表示不多。","pronunciation":["약깐"]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"划入，加上列入","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"使进入某个范围内。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/573fb0c17212f8d3f747.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.94,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=90069","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":37,"sequenceScore":1.6653,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我不要太甜的，只加一点点就好。","需要我在咖啡里加糖吗？","十八、十九、二十、二十一……"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["需要我在咖啡里加糖吗？","十八、十九、二十、二十一……","我不要太甜的，只加一点点就好。"],"answer":2}]}
